</button>
</div>
 
</div>
                <p class="text-muted mb-4">
                    The <code>lock</code> statement is generally simpler to use,
                    while Monitor provides more control over synchronization.
                </p>


                <!-- =====================================================
                     14. THREAD PRIORITY
                     ===================================================== -->
                <h3 class="fw-bold text-dark mt-5 mb-3">
                    Thread Priority
                </h3>

                <p class="text-muted mb-4">
                    A thread can have a priority that influences scheduling.
                    Available priorities include:
                </p>

                <ul class="text-muted mb-4">
                    <li>Lowest</li>
                    <li>BelowNormal</li>
                    <li>Normal</li>
                    <li>AboveNormal</li>
                    <li>Highest</li>
                </ul>

                <div class="code-block mb-4 shadow-sm">
                    <div class="code-lang-tag">C#</div>
                    <pre class="mb-0"><code>Thread thread = new Thread(Work);

thread.Priority = ThreadPriority.AboveNormal;

thread.Start();</code></pre>
                </div>

                <div class="alert alert-warning mb-4">
                    <strong>Note:</strong>
                    Thread priority is only a scheduling hint. It should not be used
                    as a guarantee that one thread will always execute before another.
                </div>


                <!-- =====================================================
                     15. BACKGROUND THREAD
                     ===================================================== -->
                <h3 class="fw-bold text-dark mt-5 mb-3">
                    Background Thread
                </h3>

                <p class="text-muted mb-4">
                    A thread can be marked as a background thread using the
                    <code>IsBackground</code> property.
                </p>

                <div class="code-block mb-4 shadow-sm">
