<i class="bi bi-play-fill me-1"></i>
            Try It
</button>
</div>
 
</div>

                <p class="text-muted mb-4">
                    The ThreadPool maintains a collection of worker threads that
                    can execute queued work items.
                </p>


                <!-- =====================================================
                     19. THREAD VS THREADPOOL
                     ===================================================== -->
                <h3 class="fw-bold text-dark mt-5 mb-3">
